{
  "abstract": "Exact expansion at the first excluded ordered prefix and a positive remainder kernel under arbitrary dependence. A universal heterogeneous Poisson–Charlier conversion bound is applied to the actual run model. Complete-law transfer explicitly assumes the 254 fixed-order connected-activity estimates; reconstruction from absolute triple activity and the resulting 4/3 upper bound are unconditional.",
